    "working_definition_verbatim": "MIDC = the Pacific Northwest / Mid-Columbia footprint = plants in WA, OR, ID, MT that are NOT in CAISO (in practice, exclude any CISO-coded units; also exclude plants in those states that report to SPP's western expansion BAs if any appear \u2014 flag them rather than silently including).",
    "implemented_as": "Plant State in {WA, OR, ID, MT} AND Balancing Authority Code != CISO. Zero CISO-coded units exist in the four states in this vintage, so the cut equals the state cut. SWPP-coded (168.2 MW snapshot) and MISO-coded (155.6 MW snapshot) units in MT fall inside the state cut: they are INCLUDED and flagged here and in README.md, not silently included; summing this stack with the SPP/MISO stacks would double-count them. PACE-coded units in ID/MT are included by state and flagged by BA. Northern Nevada (NV) is out of scope."
